{"title":"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Straighforward,_but_has_big_numbers)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Straighforward, but has big numbers)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is added to each of the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b899aba26cc33f0026125daebb44a60349c999b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/7/c772b6e291cbba9af502d58207736841b27f38b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$596$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, one obtains the squares of three consecutive terms of an arithmetic series. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Call the terms of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arithmetic_progression\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Arithmetic progression\">arithmetic progression</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/8/e0844939831e3778d87c92b10d3a74409c12f89d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,\\ a + d,\\ a + 2d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\" />, making their squares <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/d/0fda169dfef82e93e5aa3338c10f9d4feec30abb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2,\\ a^2 + 2ad + d^2,\\ a^2 + 4ad + 4d^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"265\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/b/4cb6a003e16f2e72773e46c7728633695bd798f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 = 36 + k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/c/06c79c9ac3da047efd3711df624e56966887310f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + d)^2 = 300 + k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"19\" />, and subtracting these two we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/0511b827fc695e8f70d6b7cd3292b79693f9d582.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$264 = 2ad + d^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"16\" /> (1). Similarly, using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/c/06c79c9ac3da047efd3711df624e56966887310f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + d)^2 = 300 + k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/3/063944cf7992bceba696101b96a15c387adc665c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + 2d)^2 = 596 + k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"19\" />, subtraction yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/0/bf0faef822280abe141b9f6e4b6e5d768cc5f7de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$296 = 2ad + 3d^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"126\" height=\"16\" /> (2). \n</p><p>Subtracting the first equation from the second, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/5/715e3d5deef4a4190a4216c4d86d4892562466a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2d^2 = 32$\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9b7a0f00374ac1ac5553a55795b9531d4bdf042.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />. Substituting backwards yields that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/0/c30925075c98bcb628589aae8a73db5bdbe25faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/c/4ac717ee72f7c004c0297b28e142548477da18e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = \\boxed{925}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Straighforward.2C_but_has_big_numbers.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Straighforward,_but_has_big_numbers)\">Solution 2 (Straighforward, but has big numbers)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Straighforward, but has big numbers)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since terms in an arithmetic progression have constant differences, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/8/58863e55277962efcc6e5f0e1c4981f67e6f9653.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{300+k}-\\sqrt{36+k}=\\sqrt{596+k}-\\sqrt{300+k}\\]\" width=\"357\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/f/2ffd701c21272a678a88265446c3289425933967.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 2\\sqrt{300+k} = \\sqrt{596+k}+\\sqrt{36+k}\\]\" width=\"309\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b93838539336cc74e444bbdcbd40ea03a9755ec6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 4k+1200=596+k+36+k+2\\sqrt{(596+k)(36+k)}\\]\" width=\"460\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/1/5a145f9861052c32dd58c99c17df6b0d2af95463.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 2k+568=2\\sqrt{(596+k)(36+k)}\\]\" width=\"296\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/9/23976bb332eae3ec1880cb567192a49082825fd8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies k+284=\\sqrt{(596+k)(36+k)}\\]\" width=\"278\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/0/390405e23df2008a1cd6c56147b9cc0985420847.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies k^2+568k+80656=k^2+632k+21456\\]\" width=\"351\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/5/755937eb845c70d2d5603a02fc6316f96264712d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 568k+80656=632k+21456\\]\" width=\"272\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/7/6e7557ca931fbc6bd0436cbee1efe0ca3401be6a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 64k = 59200\\]\" width=\"135\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/b/3cb8f5378c101c609dd61119c680eaa73266fba1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies k = \\boxed{925}\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the arithmetic sequence be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/0/730a04d09740e0b0f50d1140c614f6e7840e9bbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b83c9c3a8da8388f2c9107e68f8fe59683cd0cdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/b/16bcc311bca4fba21bd56667d0d93003e01725ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+d)^2-a^2 = 296$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" />, but using the difference of squares, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/7/4e7aa8b9011e1c5d29ed2b3c09bae0d8d0b15bba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d(2a+d)=296$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/5/175f0fffe9e272b43ea32896a38130e798006d82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2-(a-d)^2 = 264$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" />, and using the difference of squares we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/8/bd8784b8cdaf89dd8d3c73fdfe5311c1e88f1625.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d(2a-d) = 264$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />. Subtracting both equations gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/5/715e3d5deef4a4190a4216c4d86d4892562466a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2d^2 = 32$\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9b7a0f00374ac1ac5553a55795b9531d4bdf042.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/b/52b7bf59e10f7d19db6e57fb7df7dbb6ea711eb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 35$\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/b/52b7bf59e10f7d19db6e57fb7df7dbb6ea711eb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 35$\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/c/07c693284eeeccaf2681fd10d893670ffc6b8733.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 = 1225 = 300+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/c/4ac717ee72f7c004c0297b28e142548477da18e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = \\boxed{925}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~~Disphenoid_lover\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qL0OOYZiaqA?t=251\">https://youtu.be/qL0OOYZiaqA?t=251</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME\" title=\"1989 AIME\">1989 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1989 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017181415\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 278/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6960/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.651      1 -total\n 61.03%    8.941      1 Template:AIME_box\n 36.62%    5.365      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2856:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017181415 and revision id 227050. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}